# Views of MLX Observatory (projects/observatory/README.md): a name, " = ", a
# query (tools/codemap/query.mlx). They are listed at the end of its
# sidebar; `mlx-codemap query @NAME` answers one on the command line.
Untested std = in:std/ kind:fn untested
Allocating in std = in:std/ kind:fn uses:Allocator
Workarounds in the compiler = in:compiler/ workaround
Risky = risky
Crashed = crashed
Changed = changed
